@startuml
actor Maintainer
participant "SESN host verifier" as Verifier
participant "offline sandbox" as Sandbox
participant "X-COM preflight" as Preflight
participant "evidence store" as Evidence
Maintainer -> Verifier: run five verification measures
Verifier -> Sandbox: start with network namespace unshared
Sandbox -> Preflight: execute revision-bound measure
Preflight --> Sandbox: classified result
Sandbox --> Verifier: exit status and bounded log
Verifier -> Evidence: retain log, environment manifest, hashes, network policy
Verifier --> Maintainer: reviewable evidence IDs
@enduml
